### Frequently Asked Questions

**Do I own the full copyright to my logo and brand assets?**  
Yes, 100%. Upon project completion and final payment, Inrank transfers complete legal intellectual property and copyright ownership to your company.

**How many logo concepts do you provide?**  
Depending on the selected package, we present 3 to 5 distinct, hand-crafted design directions. We then refine your preferred concept through iterative feedback rounds until it is flawless.

**What file formats will I receive?**  
You will receive a complete master folder containing editable vector files (AI, EPS, SVG), print-ready PDFs (CMYK 300 DPI), and digital assets (transparent PNGs, JPEGs, and favicons).

